                                        <fo:block-container page-break-after="avoid" font-size="1.4em" space-after="0.5em" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" space-before="1em" role="H4" id="ariaid-title34"><fo:block end-indent="0" start-indent="0"><fo:inline background-color="transparent" color="transparent" font-size="0px" max-width="2px" vertical-align="super" id="d549e5779"/><fo:inline background-color="transparent" color="transparent" font-size="0px" max-width="2px" vertical-align="super" id="d549e5783"/><fo:inline background-color="transparent" color="transparent" font-size="0px" max-width="2px" vertical-align="super" id="d549e5787"/><fo:inline>API Dataset</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:block-container>
                                        
                                        <fo:block-container space-after="0" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" space-before="0"><fo:block end-indent="0" start-indent="0">
                                            <fo:block-container space-after="0.5em" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" space-before="0.5em"><fo:block end-indent="0" start-indent="0">This section describes the
                                                API dataset used for the vibration X-axis FFT
                                                graph.</fo:block></fo:block-container>
                                            <fo:block-container space-after="1em" space-before="1em" role="Sect"><fo:block end-indent="0" start-indent="0">
                                                <fo:block-container space-after="0.5em" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" space-before="1em"><fo:block end-indent="0" start-indent="0">This
                                                  section describes the API dataset used for the
                                                  vibration X-axis FFT graph.</fo:block></fo:block-container>
                                                <fo:block-container space-after="0.5em" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" space-before="1em"><fo:block end-indent="0" start-indent="0">The REST
                                                  APIs have access to the following dataset:</fo:block></fo:block-container>
                                            </fo:block></fo:block-container>
                                        </fo:block></fo:block-container>
                                        <fo:block role="Sect" id="unique_47" xml:lang="en-us" chfox:nd-id="vibxfft">
                                            <fo:block-container page-break-after="avoid" font-size="1.4em" space-after="0.5em" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" space-before="1em" role="H5" id="ariaid-title35"><fo:block end-indent="0" start-indent="0"><fo:inline background-color="transparent" color="transparent" font-size="0px" max-width="2px" vertical-align="super" id="d549e5849"/><fo:inline background-color="transparent" color="transparent" font-size="0px" max-width="2px" vertical-align="super" id="d549e5853"/><fo:inline background-color="transparent" color="transparent" font-size="0px" max-width="2px" vertical-align="super" id="d549e5857"/><fo:inline>vibxFFT</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:block-container>
                                            
                                            <fo:block-container space-after="0" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" space-before="0"><fo:block end-indent="0" start-indent="0">
                                                <fo:block-container space-after="0.5em" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" space-before="0.5em"><fo:block end-indent="0" start-indent="0">The Vibration X FFT
                                                  (vibxFFT) is the vibration amplitude measured in
                                                  the tangential direction of</fo:block></fo:block-container>
                                                <fo:block-container space-after="1em" space-before="1em" role="Sect"><fo:block end-indent="0" start-indent="0">
                                                  <fo:block-container space-after="0.5em" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" space-before="1em"><fo:block end-indent="0" start-indent="0">The
                                                  Vibration X FFT (vibxFFT) is the vibration
                                                  amplitude measured in the tangential direction of
                                                  the motor. This recorded data is the result of the
                                                  FFT transformation with the vibration signal X, in
                                                  the unit of decibels (dB).</fo:block></fo:block-container>
                                                  <fo:list-block relative-align="baseline" provisional-label-separation="3pt" provisional-distance-between-starts="40px" space-after="1.33em" space-before="1.33em">
                                                  <fo:list-item><fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()"><fo:block text-align="end">• </fo:block></fo:list-item-label><fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()"><fo:block><fo:block-container><fo:block start-indent="0" end-indent="0">
                                                  <fo:block-container space-after="0.5em" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" space-before="1em"><fo:block end-indent="0" start-indent="0">Each
                                                  record contains an FFT of the vibx samples
                                                  captured on the specified timestamp.</fo:block></fo:block-container>
                                                  <fo:block-container space-after="0.5em" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" space-before="1em"><fo:block end-indent="0" start-indent="0">It is
                                                  necessary to generate the corresponding X-axis
                                                  data to plot this vibxFFT data in a graphic. The
                                                  X-axis data is a vector of 7,500 data points with
                                                  a step of 0.41667 Hertz (Hz).</fo:block></fo:block-container>
                                                  </fo:block></fo:block-container></fo:block></fo:list-item-body></fo:list-item>
                                                  <fo:list-item><fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()"><fo:block text-align="end">• </fo:block></fo:list-item-label><fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()"><fo:block><fo:block-container><fo:block start-indent="0" end-indent="0">
                                                  <fo:block-container space-after="0.5em" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" space-before="1em"><fo:block end-indent="0" start-indent="0">For
                                                  example:</fo:block></fo:block-container>
                                                  </fo:block></fo:block-container></fo:block></fo:list-item-body></fo:list-item>
                                                  <fo:list-item><fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()"><fo:block text-align="end">• </fo:block></fo:list-item-label><fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()"><fo:block><fo:block-container><fo:block start-indent="0" end-indent="0">
                                                  <fo:block-container space-after="0.5em" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" space-before="1em"><fo:block end-indent="0" start-indent="0">[0.41667, 0.83334, 1.25, .... , 3125]</fo:block></fo:block-container>
                                                  <fo:block-container space-after="0.5em" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" space-before="1em"><fo:block end-indent="0" start-indent="0">The
                                                  following two datasets, Vibration Z FFT (vibzFFT)
                                                  and magnetic field FFT (fluxFFT), also use the
                                                  same time stamp to generate the FFT graphic. All 3
                                                  datasets, vibxFFT, vibzFFT</fo:block></fo:block-container>
                                                  </fo:block></fo:block-container></fo:block></fo:list-item-body></fo:list-item>
                                                  <fo:list-item><fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()"><fo:block text-align="end">• </fo:block></fo:list-item-label><fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()"><fo:block><fo:block-container><fo:block start-indent="0" end-indent="0">
                                                  <fo:block-container space-after="0.5em" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" space-before="1em"><fo:block end-indent="0" start-indent="0">For more
                                                  information on API refer to the ADI OtoSense™ SMS
                                                  REST API.</fo:block></fo:block-container>
                                                  </fo:block></fo:block-container></fo:block></fo:list-item-body></fo:list-item>
                                                  </fo:list-block>
                                                </fo:block></fo:block-container>
                                            </fo:block></fo:block-container>
                                        </fo:block>
                                    </fo:block>
                                </fo:block>
                                <fo:block role="Sect" id="unique_48" xml:lang="en-us" chfox:nd-id="vibration_x_axis_fft_absolute_value">
                                    <fo:block-container page-break-after="avoid" font-size="1.4em" space-after="0.5em" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" space-before="1em" role="H3" id="ariaid-title36"><fo:block end-indent="0" start-indent="0"><fo:inline background-color="transparent" color="transparent" font-size="0px" max-width="2px" vertical-align="super" id="d549e5950"/><fo:inline background-color="transparent" color="transparent" font-size="0px" max-width="2px" vertical-align="super" id="d549e5954"/><fo:inline background-color="transparent" color="transparent" font-size="0px" max-width="2px" vertical-align="super" id="d549e5958"/><fo:inline>Vibration X-axis FFT Absolute
                                            Value</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:block-container>
                                    
                                    <fo:block-container space-after="0" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" space-before="0"><fo:block end-indent="0" start-indent="0">
                                        <fo:block-container space-after="0.5em" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" space-before="0.5em"><fo:block end-indent="0" start-indent="0">This section
                                            describes the Vibration X-axis FFT Absolute Value. It is
                                            generated from data received</fo:block></fo:block-container>
                                        <fo:block-container space-after="0.5em" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" space-before="1em"><fo:block end-indent="0" start-indent="0">This section
                                            describes the Vibration X-axis FFT Absolute Value. It is
                                            generated from data received by the ADI OtoSense™ Server
                                            from the vibration X-axis sensor on the SMS.</fo:block></fo:block-container>
                                    </fo:block></fo:block-container>
                                    <fo:block role="Sect" id="unique_49" xml:lang="en-us" chfox:nd-id="access_the_vibration_x_axis_fft_absolute_value">
                                        <fo:block-container page-break-after="avoid" font-size="1.4em" space-after="0.5em" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" space-before="1em" role="H4" id="ariaid-title37"><fo:block end-indent="0" start-indent="0"><fo:inline background-color="transparent" color="transparent" font-size="0px" max-width="2px" vertical-align="super" id="d549e6015"/><fo:inline background-color="transparent" color="transparent" font-size="0px" max-width="2px" vertical-align="super" id="d549e6019"/><fo:inline background-color="transparent" color="transparent" font-size="0px" max-width="2px" vertical-align="super" id="d549e6023"/><fo:inline>Access the Vibration X-axis FFT
                                                Absolute Value</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:block-container>
                                        
                                        <fo:block-container space-after="0" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" space-before="0"><fo:block end-indent="0" start-indent="0">
                                            <fo:block-container space-after="0.5em" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" space-before="0.5em"><fo:block end-indent="0" start-indent="0">This section describes the
                                                process of accessing the Vibration X-axis FFT
                                                Absolute Value graph.</fo:block></fo:block-container>
                                            <fo:block-container space-after="1em" space-before="1em" role="Sect"><fo:block end-indent="0" start-indent="0">
                                                <fo:block-container space-after="0.5em" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" space-before="1em"><fo:block end-indent="0" start-indent="0">This
                                                  section describes the process of accessing the
                                                  Vibration X-axis FFT Absolute Value graph.</fo:block></fo:block-container>
                                                <fo:block-container space-after="0.5em" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" space-before="1em"><fo:block end-indent="0" start-indent="0">To
                                                  access the Vibration X-axis FFT Absolute Value
                                                  through the application:</fo:block></fo:block-container>
                                            </fo:block></fo:block-container>
                                            <fo:block role="Sect">
                                                <fo:list-block relative-align="baseline" provisional-label-separation="3pt" provisional-distance-between-starts="40px" space-after="1.33em" space-before="1.33em" id="unique_49_Connect_42_steps_10211515" chfox:nd-id="steps_10211515">
                                                  <fo:list-item space-after="1em" space-before="1em"><fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()"><fo:block text-align="end">1. </fo:block></fo:list-item-label><fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()"><fo:block><fo:block-container><fo:block start-indent="0" end-indent="0">
                                                  <fo:inline>Tap <fo:inline font-weight="bold">Motors</fo:inline>.</fo:inline>
                                                  <fo:block>
                                                  <fo:block-container space-after="0.5em" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" space-before="1em"><fo:block end-indent="0" start-indent="0">The
                                                  Locations list is displayed.</fo:block></fo:block-container>
                                                  </fo:block>
                                                  </fo:block></fo:block-container></fo:block></fo:list-item-body></fo:list-item>
                                                  <fo:list-item space-after="1em" space-before="1em"><fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()"><fo:block text-align="end">2. </fo:block></fo:list-item-label><fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()"><fo:block>
                                                  <fo:inline>Select the location
                                                  associated with the motor.</fo:inline>
                                                  </fo:block></fo:list-item-body></fo:list-item>
                                                  <fo:list-item space-after="1em" space-before="1em"><fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()"><fo:block text-align="end">3. </fo:block></fo:list-item-label><fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()"><fo:block>
                                                  <fo:inline>From the subsequent screens,
                                                  select the corresponding process, plant, and motor
                                                  name.</fo:inline>
                                                  </fo:block></fo:list-item-body></fo:list-item>
                                                  <fo:list-item space-after="1em" space-before="1em"><fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()"><fo:block text-align="end">4. </fo:block></fo:list-item-label><fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()"><fo:block>
                                                  <fo:inline>Select <fo:inline font-weight="bold">History Plot</fo:inline> and <fo:inline font-weight="bold">Parameters</fo:inline>.</fo:inline>
                                                  </fo:block></fo:list-item-body></fo:list-item>
                                                  <fo:list-item space-after="1em" space-before="1em"><fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()"><fo:block text-align="end">5. </fo:block></fo:list-item-label><fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()"><fo:block>
                                                  <fo:inline>Tap <fo:inline font-weight="bold">Select
                                                  Vibration</fo:inline> to select <fo:inline font-weight="bold">Vibration</fo:inline>
                                                  <fo:inline font-weight="bold">X
                                                  absolute value</fo:inline>.</fo:inline>
                                                  </fo:block></fo:list-item-body></fo:list-item>
                                                  <fo:list-item space-after="1em" space-before="1em"><fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()"><fo:block text-align="end">6. </fo:block></fo:list-item-label><fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()"><fo:block><fo:block-container><fo:block start-indent="0" end-indent="0">
                                                  <fo:inline>Tap <fo:inline font-weight="bold">Select
                                                  Date</fo:inline> and <fo:inline font-weight="bold">Select
                                                  Time</fo:inline> to select the date and time
                                                  corresponding to the moment of the
                                                  installation.</fo:inline>
                                                  <fo:block>
                                                  <fo:block-container space-after="0.5em" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" space-before="1em"><fo:block end-indent="0" start-indent="0">You
                                                  should see the corresponding waveform as shown in
                                                  <fo:inline>Figure
                                                  18<fo:inline font-style="italic"><fo:basic-link show-destination="new" indicate-destination="true" fox:alt-text=" " external-destination="unique_50"> (on page </fo:basic-link><fo:basic-link show-destination="new" indicate-destination="true" fox:alt-text=" " external-destination="unique_50"><fo:page-number-citation ref-id="unique_50"/></fo:basic-link><fo:basic-link show-destination="new" indicate-destination="true" fox:alt-text=" " external-destination="unique_50">)</fo:basic-link></fo:inline></fo:inline>.</fo:block></fo:block-container>
                                                  <fo:block-container space-after="1em" margin-left="40px" margin-right="40px" space-before="1em" role="Figure" id="d549e6121"><fo:block end-indent="0" start-indent="0">
                                                  <fo:block page-break-after="avoid" font-style="normal"><fo:inline>Figure<fo:inline> 32</fo:inline><fo:inline>. </fo:inline></fo:inline><fo:inline><fo:inline>Dashboard screen showing the
                                                  Vibration X FFT absolute value
                                                  waveform</fo:inline></fo:inline></fo:block>
                                                  <fo:block-container height="297px" space-after="1em" max-width="100%" width="601px"><fo:block end-indent="0" start-indent="0"><fo:inline><fo:external-graphic src="file:/C:/Users/adity/Downloads/Analytics%20User%20Guide/output/media/image38.png" fox:alt-text="placeholder" max-width="100%" scaling="non-uniform" content-width="601px" content-height="297px"/></fo:inline></fo:block></fo:block-container>
                                                  </fo:block></fo:block-container>
                                                  </fo:block>
                                                  </fo:block></fo:block-container></fo:block></fo:list-item-body></fo:list-item>
                                                  <fo:list-item space-after="1em" space-before="1em"><fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()"><fo:block text-align="end">7. </fo:block></fo:list-item-label><fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()"><fo:block>
                                                  <fo:inline>Click <fo:inline font-weight="bold">DATA
                                                  DOWNLOAD</fo:inline>to download the generated
                                                  data.</fo:inline>
                                                  </fo:block></fo:list-item-body></fo:list-item>
                                                </fo:list-block>
                                            </fo:block>
                                        </fo:block></fo:block-container>
                                    </fo:block>
                                    <fo:block role="Sect" id="unique_51" xml:lang="en-us" chfox:nd-id="data_visualization_3">
                                        <fo:block-container page-break-after="avoid" font-size="1.4em" space-after="0.5em" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" space-before="1em" role="H4" id="ariaid-title38"><fo:block end-indent="0" start-indent="0"><fo:inline background-color="transparent" color="transparent" font-size="0px" max-width="2px" vertical-align="super" id="d549e6187"/><fo:inline background-color="transparent" color="transparent" font-size="0px" max-width="2px" vertical-align="super" id="d549e6191"/><fo:inline background-color="transparent" color="transparent" font-size="0px" max-width="2px" vertical-align="super" id="d549e6195"/><fo:inline>Data Visualization</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:block-container>
                                        
                                        <fo:block-container space-after="0" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" space-before="0"><fo:block end-indent="0" start-indent="0">
                                            <fo:block-container space-after="0.5em" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" space-before="0.5em"><fo:block end-indent="0" start-indent="0">This section describes the
                                                Vibration X-axis FFT Absolute Value graph.</fo:block></fo:block-container>
                                            <fo:block-container space-after="0.5em" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" space-before="1em"><fo:block end-indent="0" start-indent="0">This
                                                section describes the Vibration X-axis FFT Absolute
                                                Value graph.</fo:block></fo:block-container>
                                            <fo:block-container space-after="0.5em" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" space-before="1em"><fo:block end-indent="0" start-indent="0">You can
                                                hover on a section of the Vibration X FFT absolute
                                                value graph to view the Vibration X FFT absolute
                                                value in metre per second squared (m/s2), the
                                                frequency in Hertz (Hz), and the time frame.</fo:block></fo:block-container>
                                            <fo:block-container space-before="1em"><fo:block end-indent="0" start-indent="0">
                                                <fo:block-container space-after="1em" margin-left="40px" margin-right="40px" space-before="1em" role="Figure" id="d549e6215"><fo:block end-indent="0" start-indent="0">
                                                  <fo:block page-break-after="avoid" font-style="normal"><fo:inline>Figure<fo:inline> 33</fo:inline><fo:inline>. </fo:inline></fo:inline><fo:inline><fo:inline>Dashboard screen highlighting
                                                  one data point of the Vibration X FFT absolute
                                                  value waveform</fo:inline></fo:inline></fo:block>
                                                  <fo:block-container height="302px" space-after="1em" max-width="100%" width="601px"><fo:block end-indent="0" start-indent="0"><fo:inline><fo:external-graphic src="file:/C:/Users/adity/Downloads/Analytics%20User%20Guide/output/media/image39.png" fox:alt-text="placeholder" max-width="100%" scaling="non-uniform" content-width="601px" content-height="302px"/></fo:inline></fo:block></fo:block-container>
                                                </fo:block></fo:block-container>
                                            </fo:block></fo:block-container>
                                        </fo:block></fo:block-container>
                                        <fo:block role="Sect" id="unique_52" xml:lang="en-us" chfox:nd-id="sample_data_3">
                                            <fo:block-container page-break-after="avoid" font-size="1.4em" space-after="0.5em" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" space-before="1em" role="H5" id="ariaid-title39"><fo:block end-indent="0" start-indent="0"><fo:inline background-color="transparent" color="transparent" font-size="0px" max-width="2px" vertical-align="super" id="d549e6270"/><fo:inline background-color="transparent" color="transparent" font-size="0px" max-width="2px" vertical-align="super" id="d549e6274"/><fo:inline background-color="transparent" color="transparent" font-size="0px" max-width="2px" vertical-align="super" id="d549e6278"/><fo:inline>Sample Data</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:block-container>
                                            
                                            <fo:block-container space-after="0" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" space-before="0"><fo:block end-indent="0" start-indent="0">
                                                <fo:block-container space-after="0.5em" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" space-before="0.5em"><fo:block end-indent="0" start-indent="0">Sample of the Vibration X
