                                                  <fo:block page-break-after="avoid" font-style="normal"><fo:inline>Figure<fo:inline> 34</fo:inline><fo:inline>. </fo:inline></fo:inline><fo:inline><fo:inline>Sample of the Vibration X FFT
                                                  absolute value waveform</fo:inline></fo:inline></fo:block>
                                                  <fo:block-container height="210px" space-after="1em" max-width="100%" width="602px"><fo:block end-indent="0" start-indent="0"><fo:inline><fo:external-graphic src="file:/C:/Users/adity/Downloads/Analytics%20User%20Guide/output/media/image40.png" fox:alt-text="placeholder" max-width="100%" scaling="non-uniform" content-width="602px" content-height="210px"/></fo:inline></fo:block></fo:block-container>
                                                  </fo:block></fo:block-container>
                                                </fo:block></fo:block-container>
                                                <fo:block-container space-after="0.5em" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" space-before="1em"><fo:block end-indent="0" start-indent="0">Figure
                                                  20 is a waveform graph showing Fast Fourier
                                                  Transform absolute value in metres per second
                                                  squared (m/s2) data from the X-axis sensor.</fo:block></fo:block-container>
                                                <fo:list-block relative-align="baseline" provisional-label-separation="3pt" provisional-distance-between-starts="40px" space-after="1.33em" space-before="1.33em" id="unique_52_Connect_42_ul_10211518" chfox:nd-id="ul_10211518">
                                                  <fo:list-item><fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()"><fo:block text-align="end">• </fo:block></fo:list-item-label><fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()"><fo:block>The graph’s X-axis shows frequency in Hertz.</fo:block></fo:list-item-body></fo:list-item>
                                                  <fo:list-item><fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()"><fo:block text-align="end">• </fo:block></fo:list-item-label><fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()"><fo:block>The graph’s Y-Axis shows the absolute value of
