                                                to view the motor temperature, date, and time.</fo:block></fo:block-container>
                                            <fo:block-container space-before="1em"><fo:block end-indent="0" start-indent="0">
                                                <fo:block-container space-after="1em" margin-left="40px" margin-right="40px" space-before="1em" role="Figure" id="d549e10792"><fo:block end-indent="0" start-indent="0">
